r John that he knew didn't belong  there something that would break  tradition whether it be an artifact  pointing the John Stehr parentage or  tomb of his own even though Ned knows  that a bastard doesn't belong there  which is why John always had the dreams  of him screaming that he is not a stark  that this isn't his place Ned also had  nightmares of the crypts something  disturbs him about them which makes me  think that Ned may have reserved a place  for John down there even though he is in  a legitimate stark but there are other  things Ned could have possibly left  behind  for John define to help him understand  or even confirm just who he is everyone  that knows this story knows that John's  father Rhaegar Targaryen is most  famously known for playing his harp and  he didn't just play this thing he pretty  much took it everywhere he went almost  every time Rhaegar is mentioned in the  books they mentioned his harp as well  which is basically in every book in the  series so I guarantee he took that heart  with him to the Tower of joy and I also  would guarantee that Rhaegar would play  the harp while Liana was pregnant with  John I think he would probably play the  harp in sing to him while he was inside  of Liana still the heart was obviously  something very near and dear to Rhea  Gore's heart something I could see him  having with him at the Tower of joy and  something I could see him leaving behind  with Liana when he knew he had to leave  and I think if Rhaegar thought there was  a chance that he wouldn't come back then  I could see Rhaegar leaving behind his  most prized possession for his son and  this was something Ned should have been  aware of  even if Liana didn't tell him most  people knew about him and his harp I  think this is something Ned could have  put in the crypts for John for when the  time comes to help confirm just who his  father was but there is also something  else that should be noted something that  Littlefinger once said Littlefing